sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant AppUI as App UI
    participant MedLogCtrl as MedicationLog<br/>Controller
    participant MedLogSvc as MedicationLog<br/>Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant NotifSvc as Notification<br/>Service

    User->>AppUI: Open due medication card
    AppUI->>MedLogCtrl: POST /medication-log (status action)
    MedLogCtrl->>MedLogSvc: validate status transition
    MedLogSvc->>DB: fetch scheduled dose window
    DB-->>MedLogSvc: scheduled record + prior state
    MedLogSvc->>MedLogSvc: compute next status + timestamps
    MedLogSvc->>DB: UPDATE medication_log state
    DB-->>MedLogSvc: DB update ack
    
    alt Status Changed
        alt Status = MISSED
            MedLogSvc->>NotifSvc: if status=MISSED trigger alert
        else Status = SKIPPED
            MedLogSvc->>NotifSvc: if status=SKIPPED create warning
        else Status = TAKEN
            MedLogSvc->>NotifSvc: if status=TAKEN log positive note
        end
        NotifSvc->>DB: persist notification event
        DB-->>NotifSvc: return event id
        NotifSvc-->>MedLogSvc: notification created
    end
    
    MedLogSvc-->>MedLogCtrl: status response object
    MedLogCtrl-->>AppUI: UI toast + updated badge
